_artifact":"harvest/phase2_optimized_2026-10-29/divisors_a/INDEPENDENT_VALIDATION.jsonl","logical_form":"equivalence","mathematical_review_date":"2026-10-29","original_draft":"harvest/section_walk_scale300_2026-10-28/s21_reviews.jsonl","original_draft_sha256":"d443abd6a43b0dee6c1e75081ba0ee9dc895e92a117025c53654ae20ba38e9f2","original_source_statement_tex":"\label{lemma-noetherian-dim-1-CM-no-embedded-points}
Let $X$ be a locally Noetherian scheme of dimension $\leq 1$.
The following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
